---
import Kivirik from '../Kivirik.astro';
import ServiceTile from '../ServiceTile.astro';
import { FREE_LIMIT } from '../../config';
---

<section class="section" aria-labelledby="features-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="pill">Özellikler</span>
      <h2 id="features-title">Kâsede ne var, ne yok, hep bil.</h2>
      <p>Aboneliklerin tek listede; fiyatlar, toplamlar ve yaklaşan ödemeler kendiliğinden güncel.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="bento">
      {/* 1. Otomatik fiyat takibi */}
      <article class="card f f-wide f-zam">
        <div class="f-copy">
          <h3>Otomatik fiyat takibi</h3>
          <p class="tagline">Zamları sen takip etme. Kıvırık etsin.</p>
          <p>Fiyatlar düzenli olarak resmi sayfalardan taranır; zam olunca listen kendiliğinden güncellenir.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="f-art zam-art" aria-hidden="true">
          {/* Örnek görünüm: servis adı ve tutarlar temsilîdir */}
          <div class="mock zam-card">
            <div class="mock-top">
              <span class="pill">Zam</span>
              <span class="muted">Bu sabah</span>
            </div>
            <span class="sample">Örnek</span>
            <div class="mock-row">
              <ServiceTile letter="M" tone="pembe" class="mini" />
              <div class="grow">
                <strong>Müzik servisi</strong>
                <span class="muted">Bireysel</span>
              </div>
              <div class="price">
                <s>59,99 ₺</s>
                <strong>79,99 ₺</strong>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="zam-kivirik"><Kivirik pose="zam" /></div>
        </div>
      </article>

      {/* 2. Toplam gider ve kategoriler */}
      <article class="card f">
        <div class="f-art" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="mock">
            <span class="muted">Bu ay toplam</span>
            <span class="big">1.248 ₺</span>
            <div class="bars">
              <span style="--w: 38%; --c: var(--biber)"></span>
              <span style="--w: 24%; --c: var(--safran)"></span>
              <span style="--w: 22%; --c: #7c6cf0"></span>
              <span style="--w: 16%; --c: #2fb487"></span>
            </div>
            <div class="legend">
              <span style="--c: var(--biber)">Dizi & film</span>
              <span style="--c: var(--safran)">Müzik</span>
              <span style="--c: #7c6cf0">Yapay zekâ</span>
              <span style="--c: #2fb487">Bulut</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <h3>Toplam gider ve kategoriler</h3>
        <p>Aylık ve yıllık toplamını, paranın hangi kategoriye gittiğini tek bakışta gör.</p>
      </article>

      {/* 3. Yaklaşan ödemeler */}
      <article class="card f">
        <div class="f-art" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="mock list">
            <div class="mock-row">
              <span class="day"><b>3</b>gün</span>
              <div class="grow"><strong>Video servisi</strong><span class="muted">Aylık</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="mock-row">
              <span class="day"><b>8</b>gün</span>
              <div class="grow"><strong>Bulut depolama</strong><span class="muted">Aylık</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="mock-row">
              <span class="day"><b>21</b>gün</span>
              <div class="grow"><strong>Yapay zekâ</strong><span class="muted">Yıllık</span></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <h3>Yaklaşan ödemeler</h3>
        <p>Hangi abonelik ne zaman yenileniyor, sırayla listende. İzin verirsen ödemeden önce cihazında hatırlatma alırsın.</p>
      </article>

      {/* 4. Dolar → TL */}
      <article class="card f">
        <div class="f-art" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="fx">
            <span class="cur usd">$</span>
            <svg viewBox="0 0 60 24" width="60" height="24" fill="none"><path d="M4 12 C14 4 22 20 32 12 C40 6 46 12 54 12 M46 5 L55 12 L46 19" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" /></svg>
            <span class="cur try">₺</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <h3>Dolar fiyatlar TL’ye çevrilir</h3>
        <p>Dolar fiyatlı aboneliklerin de toplama Türk lirası olarak girer.</p>
      </article>

      {/* 5. Misafir modu */}
      <article class="card f">
        <div class="f-art" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="guest">
            {Array.from({ length: FREE_LIMIT }, (_, i) => <span class:list={['slot', { on: i < 3 }]} />)}
          </div>
          <span class="muted center">3 / {FREE_LIMIT} · hesapsız</span>
        </div>
        <h3>Misafir modu</h3>
        <p>Hesap açmadan, {FREE_LIMIT} aboneliğe kadar cihazında dene.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .bento {
    display: grid;
    gap: 14px;
  }
  @media (min-width: 700px) {
    .bento {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
    .f-wide {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
    }
  }
  @media (min-width: 1000px) {
    .bento {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    }
    .f-wide {
      grid-column: span 4;
    }
  }

  .f {
    display: grid;
    align-content: start;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 14px 14px 24px;
  }
  .f > h3,
  .f > p {
    padding-inline: 8px;
  }
  .f h3 {
    font-size: 1.3125rem;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }
  .f p {
    color: var(--text-2);
    font-size: 0.9688rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .f-art {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    min-height: 168px;
    padding: 18px;
    border-radius: calc(var(--r-card) - 10px);
    background: var(--bg);
  }

  /* Geniş zam kartı */
  .f-zam {
    padding: 14px;
    background: var(--ink);
    color: #f5f3f7;
    --text-2: #a9a5b0;
  }
  .f-zam .f-copy {
    display: grid;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 18px 10px 8px;
  }
  .f-zam h3 {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--safran);
    font-size: 1rem;
    letter-spacing: 0;
  }
  .f-zam .tagline {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 7vw, 2.5rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    line-height: 1.02;
    color: #f5f3f7;
  }
  .zam-art {
    position: relative;
    background: #1f1c26;
    padding: 28px 18px 18px;
    min-height: 220px;
  }
  .zam-kivirik {
    position: absolute;
    right: -6px;
    bottom: -4px;
    width: 120px;
    --kase-govde: #f5f3f7;
    --kase-agiz: #dcd9e0;
    --kase-serit: #c8312a;
  }
  .zam-card {
    align-self: start;
    justify-self: start;
    width: min(100%, 300px);
  }
  @media (min-width: 700px) {
    .f-zam {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .f-zam .f-copy {
      padding: 24px;
    }
    .zam-kivirik {
      width: 150px;
    }
  }

  /* Ortak mini arayüz parçaları */
  .mock {
    display: grid;
    gap: 10px;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 300px;
    padding: 14px;
    border-radius: 18px;
    background: var(--card);
    color: var(--text);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    line-height: 1.25;
  }
  .f-zam .mock {
    background: #ffffff;
    color: var(--ink);
    --text-2: #5f5b66;
    --pill-bg: rgba(200, 49, 42, 0.1);
    --pill-text: #b4271f;
  }
  .zam-card {
    position: relative;
  }
  .sample {
    position: absolute;
    top: -10px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    padding: 2px 10px;
    border-radius: var(--r-pill);
    background: var(--ink);
    color: #f5f3f7;
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }
  .mock-top {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .mock-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .mock :global(.mini) {
    width: 40px;
    padding: 0;
    box-shadow: none;
    background: transparent;
  }
  .mock :global(.mini span) {
    font-size: 1rem;
  }
  .grow {
    flex: 1;
    display: grid;
    gap: 2px;
    min-width: 0;
  }
  .muted {
    color: var(--text-2);
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
  }
  .center {
    text-align: center;
  }
  .price {
    display: grid;
    justify-items: end;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
  }
  .price s {
    color: var(--text-2);
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
  }
  .price strong {
    color: var(--biber-yazi);
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-weight: 800;
  }
  .big {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .bars {
    display: flex;
    gap: 3px;
    height: 12px;
  }
  .bars span {
    width: var(--w);
    border-radius: 99px;
    background: var(--c);
  }
  .legend {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 4px 12px;
    color: var(--text-2);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
  }
  .legend span::before {
    content: '';
    display: inline-block;
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    margin-right: 5px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--c);
  }
  .list {
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .day {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    flex: none;
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: var(--pill-bg);
    color: var(--pill-text);
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .day b {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-weight: 800;
  }
  .fx {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    color: var(--text-2);
  }
  .cur {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 72px;
    height: 72px;
    border-radius: 24px;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 2.25rem;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  }
  .usd {
    background: var(--card);
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .try {
    background: var(--safran);
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .guest {
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
  }
  .slot {
    width: 36px;
    height: 36px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    border: 2px dashed var(--placeholder-text);
    opacity: 0.6;
  }
  .slot.on {
    border: 0;
    opacity: 1;
    background: var(--safran);
  }
</style>
